      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that. I think I see what you're going for with the tone. \n\nCan we actually expand on the \"Early Human Ingenuity\" part? I want to make sure we aren't just calling it \"resourceful\" without explaining the vibe. For these indigenous groups, can you lean more into that connection they have with the natural world? Like, describe their tools and knowledge in a way that emphasizes that more spiritual, intuitive, or instinctual way of living in harmony with nature, compared to the more \"calculated\" European approach in the next section.",
